  "content": "<p>Kitty and Fritz, the resident Bernese mountain dogs at the St. Regis Aspen Resort, hosted the “Haunted Hotel” on Friday in Aspen. A Halloween party in spirit for dogs and humans alike, activities included pumpkin decorating, a costume contest, trick or treating for the kids, and plenty of sweet treats.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221030/EDLdogs-atd-103026-12-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p><figcaption>Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel wouldn’t be complete without its namesake stars, seen here, on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen.</figcaption><figcaption>Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220821/EDLdogs-atd-103026-10-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p><figcaption>A small witch-dog gets its hat adjusted during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</figcaption><figcaption>Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220250/EDLdogs-atd-103026-05-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p><figcaption>A young guest eyes the camera during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</figcaption><figcaption>Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220442/EDLdogs-atd-103026-07-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p><figcaption>A costumed dog enjoys Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</figcaption><figcaption>Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30222736/EDLdogs-atd-103026-20-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p><figcaption>Tarot card readings were part of the festivities at Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</figcaption><figcaption>Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n                \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Spider-Man enjoys the arts and crafts during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220033/EDLdogs-atd-103026-02-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A costumed dog gets up on two legs with hopes for a treat at Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30181455/EDLdogs-atd-103026-01-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A dog enjoys a pup cup during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220112/EDLdogs-atd-103026-03-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                              \n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Guests enjoy Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221402/EDLdogs-atd-103026-16-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Dogs say hello to each other at Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221450/EDLdogs-atd-103026-17-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <l