tz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220159/EDLdogs-atd-103026-04-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Doughnuts awaits guests during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220703/EDLdogs-atd-103026-09-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A young guest eyes the camera during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220250/EDLdogs-atd-103026-05-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A young girl experiences a tarot card reading during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221123/EDLdogs-atd-103026-13-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A dog sits for a treat during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30220544/EDLdogs-atd-103026-08-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A young witch enjoys Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    \n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A small, costumed dog enjoys Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221213/EDLdogs-atd-103026-14-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n               