ted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30223012/EDLdogs-atd-103026-23-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel wouldn’t be complete without its namesake stars, seen here, on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221030/EDLdogs-atd-103026-12-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>A child discovers the fun of a mini pumpkin during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times</p>\n                                \n                                    <p><img src=\"https://swiftmedia.s3.amazonaws.com/mountain.swiftcom.com/images/sites/5/2026/10/30221309/EDLdogs-atd-103026-15-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n                                \n                            </li>\n                                        <li>\n                                <p><strong>Pie awaits guests during Kitty and Fritz’s Haunted Hotel on Friday, Oct. 30, 2026, at St. Regis Aspen Resort.</strong><br />Austin Colbert/The Aspen Times